# Never bake secrets or local-only switches into an image layer.
# `.env.local` holds GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET, SESSION_SECRET, DEBUG_TOKEN and
# ALLOW_DEV_LOGIN — all of which must come from the runtime environment.
